msgid ""
"Enter the full path to the pre-roll video file. If multiple paths separated "
"by commas are entered, videos will be played sequentially. If multiple paths"
" separated by semi-colons are used, a single pre-roll video will be chosen "
"randomly from the list."
msgstr ""
"Ange hela sökvägen till videofilen före rullning. Om flera sökvägar "
"separeras med kommatecken anges videoklipp i följd. Om flera sökvägar "
